{"title":"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the sum of the solutions to the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/1/f414e4ec0db945c286625cf56d2b6c7ede93f99d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[4]{x} = \\frac{12}{7 - \\sqrt[4]{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"110\" height=\"41\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/8/f5838ae6bb955f1f7afe1c28d870b6cd091b78ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\sqrt[4]{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" />. Then we have\n<b><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/5/315b5bf5fba365dbfbf7ea1596d08c24accdd853.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y(7 - y) = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\" /></b>, or, by simplifying,\n<b><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/1/f2177dfb0ca3080c826bfa7e508ae0dcd37ef80e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y^2 - 7y + 12 = (y - 3)(y - 4) = 0.\\]\" width=\"269\" height=\"19\" /></b>\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/3/723fc9924d37616a4675a26e831751451b6904d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[4]{x} = y = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" /> or <b><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /></b>.\n</p><p>Thus the sum of the possible solutions for <b><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /></b> is <b><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/2/042d677b2b993084f1a913621a3be8d8fe253fe2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^4 + 3^4 = \\boxed{337}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\" /></b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME\" title=\"1986 AIME\">1986 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selfl